From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shupeng Xue <dspxue@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 13:12:31 +1100
Subject: [PATCH wireless-next 08/19] b43: HT-PHY: 5 GHz, 802.11n and the rest
 (not yet split, not for submission)

Everything else from b43-ht: 5 GHz support (channel and gain tables,
power control, calibrations), 802.11n (HT rates, A-MPDU, 40 MHz, LDPC
receive), per-channel PHY settings, and further fixes still to be split
out (controller restart, PM bit during scans, slot time on band
switch, ...). See NOTES.md in https://github.com/Xerxes-2/b43-ht.

Assisted-by: pi:claude-opus-5-5
